{
  "id": "section-search-rolls",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Search Rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,491,504]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You will often look for creatures or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,504,541]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "items, or general information\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,541,571]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "about the mysteries around you.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,571,603]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Whenever you enter a box and you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,603,636]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "play an encounter, or there is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,636,667]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "nothing in the box, you may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,667,695]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "perform a Search roll. Write an S in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,695,732]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the box as a reminder that you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,732,763]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "searched it. You have only one\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,763,794]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance of searching each box.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,794,824]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Exceptions: you may NOT Search a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,824,857]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Safe House. You may Search a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,857,886]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "library multiple times, but the only\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,886,923]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "thing you can find is a book or 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,923,957]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Clue. To perform a Search, roll d6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,957,992]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "on the Search table below. Add +1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,992,1026]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "if you have the Investigator Skill, or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,1026,1065]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "+2 if you have Investigator (Expert).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,1065,1103]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "A roll of 1 remains a 1: do not add\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,1103,1139]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "modifiers if you roll a 1.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,1139,1166]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "search rolls table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,1491,1515]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 Roll on the random encounter table, p.39.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,1515,1559]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2-5 Nothing found.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,1559,1578]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6 Success! Roll 4 times on the Useful Items table or on the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,1578,1638]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Random Object table, and pick a single result; OR  gain 1 Clue.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,1638,1702]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Roll at +1 if you have the Investigator Skill, +2 if you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,1702,1764]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-search-rolls:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Investigator (Expert). A roll of 1 remains a 1.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[38,1764,1811]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    38
  ]
}
